{#-
  A newsletter: signed off beside the brand's round avatar, with an
  unsubscribe link in the footer. A campaign extends this and fills
  `subject`, `preheader`, `content` and `text`. Context:
    unsubscribe_url  the recipient's own unsubscribe link.

  Who it is from. Left alone, a newsletter is from the team: signed
  "Quill Medical Team" or "Let's Do Digital Team", after the brand it
  goes out as, and sent under that name. A campaign that is from a
  person says so with `set`, straight after its `extends`:

    {% extends "newsletter.html.j2" %}
    {% set signoff_name = "Mark Bailey" %}
    {% set signoff_role = "Bailey Medics" %}
    {% set from_name = "Mark at Quill Medical" %}

    signoff_name  who signs it, in bold beside the avatar
    signoff_role  the line beneath: a job title or an organisation.
                  Left out, there is no second line
    from_name     the name an inbox shows as the sender. Left out, it is
                  the same as signoff_name

  Any of the three may be set without the others. Only a template that
  extends this one directly can set them: the lines below read what the
  campaign set and fill in the rest.

  A campaign's `text` block ends with {{ signoff_text }}, which is the
  name, and the role after a comma where there is one, so the plain-text
  version is signed the same way.
-#}
{% extends "base.html.j2" %}
{% set signoff_name = signoff_name | default(t.sender_name ~ " Team") %}
{% set signoff_role = signoff_role | default("") %}
{% set from_name = from_name | default(signoff_name) %}
{% set signoff_text = signoff_name ~ (", " ~ signoff_role if signoff_role else "") %}
{% import "_company.html.j2" as company with context %}
{% block body %}
{% block content %}{% endblock %}
{#- The avatar is one image with its circle drawn in: Outlook ignores
    border-radius and would draw a square. -#}
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin: 16px 0 0">
  <tr>
    <td style="padding-right: 16px; vertical-align: middle">
      <img src="{{ asset(t.avatar) }}" width="56" height="56" alt="" style="width: 56px; height: 56px" />
    </td>
    <td style="vertical-align: middle">
      <p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 700">{{ signoff_name }}</p>
      {%- if signoff_role %}
      <p class="em-muted" style="margin: 0; font-size: 19px; color: {{ t.muted }}">{{ signoff_role }}</p>
      {%- endif %}
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>
{% endblock %}
{% block footer %}
<p style="margin: 0 0 8px">{{ t.newsletter_reason }}</p>
<p style="margin: 0 0 8px">
  <a href="{{ unsubscribe_url }}" style="color: {{ t.footer_link }}; text-decoration: underline">Unsubscribe</a>
</p>
<p style="margin: 0">
  {{ company.trading_line(registered=true) }}
</p>
{% endblock %}
